{"sections":[],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre","doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNMapView"]]},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The complete list of annotations associated with the receiver that are"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"currently visible."}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnmapview\/visibleannotations"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"occ"}]}],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"metadata":{"remoteSource":{"fileName":"MLNMapView.h","url":"https:\/\/github.com\/maplibre\/maplibre-native\/blob\/main\/platform\/ios\/src\/MLNMapView.h#L1911"},"symbolKind":"property","fragments":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"visibleAnnotations"}],"title":"visibleAnnotations","modules":[{"name":"MapLibre"}],"roleHeading":"Instance Property","externalID":"c:objc(cs)MLNMapView(py)visibleAnnotations","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"visibleAnnotations"}],"role":"symbol"},"kind":"symbol","primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["iOS","iPadOS","Mac Catalyst"],"tokens":[{"text":"@property","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" (","kind":"text"},{"text":"nonatomic","kind":"keyword"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"readonly","kind":"keyword"},{"text":") ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"c:Q$objc(cs)NSArray","text":"NSArray<id<MLNAnnotation>>"},{"kind":"text","text":" * "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"visibleAnnotations"},{"kind":"text","text":";"}],"languages":["occ"]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"discussion","text":"Discussion"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The objects in this array must adopt the "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNAnnotation"},{"type":"text","text":" protocol. If no"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"annotations are associated with